  "titleText": {
    "es": "Somos máquinas de Von Neumann muy, muy sexys",
    "en": "We are very, very sexy Von Neumann machines.",
    "noteEn": "The title text compares human reproduction to John von Neumann's theoretical self-reproducing machines; the comparison is the joke, not a literal technical claim."
